{"seq":2,"slug":"algorithms","title":"核心算法","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/algorithms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sequential-model-based","title":"序贯模型优化（SMBO）","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/algorithms/sequential-model-based","wordCount":1644,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"tree-parzen-estimators","title":"TPE 与 BOHB","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/algorithms/tree-parzen-estimators","wordCount":1618,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-fidelity-methods","title":"多保真度方法","url":"/h/mathematics-statistics/bayesian-optimization-hyperparameter/algorithms/multi-fidelity-methods","wordCount":1751,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 核心算法\n\n基础理论回答了\"用什么模型、怎么选下一个点\"，本章则回答\"如何把这些组件组装成完整的优化循环\"。序贯模型优化（SMBO）是贝叶斯优化的主循环框架；TPE 与 BOHB 引入了非参数密度估计和多保真度调度的融合思路；多保真度方法则系统性地利用低成本近似评估来加速搜索。三种算法族代表了从精确但昂贵到粗糙但高效的连续谱——实际选择取决于评估预算、参数维度和问题结构。\n"}